        "content_writing": "<p><em><strong>The three pie charts below show the changes in annual spending by a particular UK school in 1981, 1991 and 2001. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - UK School Spending: 1981, 1991 &amp; 2001</em></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\"><em><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"34582860\">Xem livestream giải đề n&agrave;y c&ugrave;ng thầy Phạm Minh Khoa (<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>2 lần 9.0</strong></span>) <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/live/6Ixzdc-Gq9M?si=cMrbgNAY7xQK2AQl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">tại đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute;!</a></span></span></em></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GSfZdFZOWo4qLSxeFS1lCO9Wggc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LHFkde6xloFkTWxucY7ly8kNgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrDFdCeWqoFwNXxm6XmlZe9tgXe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/task-1-pie-charts\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Giới thiệu dạng Pie Charts</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrDFdCeWqoFwNXxm6XmlZe9tgXe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề UK School Spending: 1981, 1991 &amp; 2001 cho ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh 3 biểu đồ tr&ograve;n thể hiện c&aacute;ch ph&acirc;n bổ ng&acirc;n s&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng năm của một trường học ở UK v&agrave;o 5 hạng mục kh&aacute;c nhau trong 3 năm: 1981, 1991 v&agrave; 2001.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrDFdCeWqoFwNXxm6XmlZe9tgXe\" data-list=\"bullet\">Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> </strong><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;</span><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> </strong><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AENmd32dPoMrGZxIEABlAuMdgLc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ApbAdUVkuo3ewPxp2FTlkwkHgTf\">Paraphrase đề UK School Spending: 1981, 1991 &amp; 2001 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: ph&acirc;n bổ ng&acirc;n s&aacute;ch - năm hạng mục - một trường học ở UK - 3 năm - 1981, 1991, v&agrave; 2001.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ApbAdUVkuo3ewPxp2FTlkwkHgTf\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-VjnxdBVPEoNboPxTTI1lbeSQgFd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh sau:</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-VjnxdBVPEoNboPxTTI1lbeSQgFd\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EXH6d8BkZoJ2wnxEnOdlErjHgQb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>Salaries (bao gồm cả teachers' v&agrave; other workers') chiếm tỷ trọng lớn nhất trong ng&acirc;n s&aacute;ch, trong đ&oacute; teachers' salaries lu&ocirc;n chiếm tỷ lệ cao nhất | Insurance c&oacute; tỷ trọng thấp nhất trong suốt giai đoạn</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-APeudfcnGokeKfxzDvQl1ZTYg0b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y64adEmVToufY9xgo7MlLUUggdg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGrCdKs3EoRTI8xSSZTlftRagDf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1: Teachers' salaries, other workers' salaries v&agrave; furniture and equipment</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGrCdKs3EoRTI8xSSZTlftRagDf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KB6Qd968KoFGK1xPlJflTQv8gWh\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gxx7d9xazo6IioxEiGGl3WRbgWc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng</strong> của teachers' salaries qua 3 năm (40% -&gt; 50% -&gt; 45%)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IQICdzSr5o2HbXxSZDFl49QRgOe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>So s&aacute;nh</strong> với other workers' salaries, nhấn mạnh sự giảm (28% -&gt; 22% -&gt; 15%)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KKdNdFC7gojHpYxAPzjld6eYg9c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả biến động mạnh</strong> của furniture and equipment (15% -&gt; 5% -&gt; 23%)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mbzedd8InobOS6x7zPyloeITgRc\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mbzedd8InobOS6x7zPyloeITgRc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2: Resources v&agrave; Insurance</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mbzedd8InobOS6x7zPyloeITgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KVVsdMv7hopV1sxs6f8loCzeg4e\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F8Oidne7WoQjsSxGkkhlPd4fgWe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng giảm</strong> của resources (15% -&gt; 20% -&gt; 9% trong 20 năm)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KUTVdq56doGzegxWtCglqrDpgwe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) Đối lập (in stark contrast) với <strong>xu hướng tăng</strong> của insurance (tăng gấp 4 lần từ 2% l&ecirc;n 8%)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Trong b&agrave;i n&agrave;y, để diễn đạt \"chi ti&ecirc;u h&agrave;ng năm\" m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng \"the annual expenditure\" hay \"how STH allocated its budget\" để tăng sự đa dạng nh&eacute;.</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZD6tdIMdCoiL2cxB0EqlkTEPgnf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZD6tdIMdCoiL2cxB0EqlkTEPgnf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Regarding the major components, teachers&rsquo; salaries accounted for 40% of <strong>the annual expenditure</strong> in 1981, half of the budget in 1991, and finally, 5% less than that figure in the final year, at 45% in 2001.&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZD6tdIMdCoiL2cxB0EqlkTEPgnf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The pie chart gives information about <strong>how a school in the UK allocated its budget</strong> to five categories in three different years, 1981, 1991, and 2001.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZD6tdIMdCoiL2cxB0EqlkTEPgnf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 253,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PKyvdnGsqoyowkxG30flMvT9gMg\">The pie chart gives information about how a school in the UK allocated its budget to five categories in three different years, 1981, 1991, and 2001.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13677,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 254,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KriWdOkICoMobkxpIIklfJIXgyd\">Overall, it is clear salaries made up the biggest proportion of each yearly budget, and teachers received the largest share collectively, while insurance was the least significant cost overall.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13677,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 255,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HkIddceVQolQ9ux1eqal4zTCgTh\">Regarding the major components, teachers&rsquo; salaries accounted for 40% of the annual expenditure in 1981, half of the budget in 1991, and finally, 5% less than that figure in the final year, at 45% in 2001. This is three times higher than the amount going to the remaining staff at the school in 2001, which experienced a relative decline throughout the period, as the figure was initially up to 28% in 1981. Oddly, furniture and equipment spending stood at 15% in the first year, dipped by two-thirds to 5% by the next recorded period, before it regaining its position again, ultimately ending up at 23% in 2001.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13677,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 256,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqtzdLrfWoeEfXxnVYhlpjtLgue\">The portion of annual spending used for school resources, such as books, came in at 15% in 1981, but declined to only 9% in the next 20 years. This is in stark contrast to the insurance spending trend, which was gradually allocated more funding, rising fourfold from a negligible 2% to 8% in the final year.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13677,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
